      "filename": "Blasting at the Penrhyn Quarry viewed from Cwm Ffrydlas - geograph.org.uk - 432420.jpg",
      "title": "File:Blasting at the Penrhyn Quarry viewed from Cwm Ffrydlas - geograph.org.uk - 432420.jpg",
